{"articleNo":"1647","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1647&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"승용차 5부제 제외 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.03.14","hit":"9204","attachments":[{"name":"승용차5부제제외신청안내(공지)2.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1647&attachNo=71273"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">승용차 5부제 제외 신청 안내</span><br><br>정부에서는 에너지 위기 “주의경보”발령에 따라 범국가적 에너지 절약의 일환<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">으로 승용차 5부제를 강화 시행하고 있으며, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">우리대학은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">전 교직원 및 학생의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">승용차 5부제 준수를</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 원칙으로 하고 있습니다.</span></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">이에, 승용차 5부제 운행이 현실적으로 어려운 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">교직원 및 학생에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 대하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">제외신청을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">받아 심의 후 승인 여부를 결정하고자 하니, 붙임 자료를 참고하여 관련 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">서</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">류를 3. 16.(수)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">까지 사무국 총무팀(본관 502호, ☎7095)으로 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.<br><br>※ 3.16.(수) 이후 제외신청 사유가 발생하여 신청서를 제출할 시 사무국총무팀(본관 502호, ☎7095)으로 문의바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">첨부파일&nbsp;: 승용차 5부제 제외신청 안내 1부</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
